    (3)Add leaf node. path:/configuration/adm-mgr/global-configuration/password/password-duration/remind-before-expire.
    (4)Add feature node 'password-duration'." ;
  }

  revision 2020-09-21 {
    description '(1)node path: /state/adm-mgr/user-info/encrypt-password,The ciphertext of the password is changed from ciphertext character string to ******.&#xD;
(2)node path: /state/adm-mgr/rootuser-info/encrypt-password,The ciphertext of the password is changed from ciphertext character string to ******.' ;
