  revision 2020-07-07 {
    description "(1)Change the node '/configuration/adm-mgr/usernames/username/cleartext-password' datatype from 'chars' to \"plaintext\"
    (2)Change the node '/configuration/adm-mgr/usernames/username/irreversible-cleartext-password' datatype from 'chars' to \"plaintext\"
