    (4)Change the node '/configuration/adm-mgr/usernames/username/irreversible-encrypted-password' datatype from 'chars' to \"ciphertext\"
    (5)Change the node '/configuration/adm-mgr/global-configuration/user-groups/user-group/unencrypted-password' datatype from 'chars' to \"plaintext\"
    (6)Change the node '/configuration/adm-mgr/global-configuration/user-groups/user-group/encrypted-password' datatype from 'chars' to \"plaintext\"
    (7)Extend the length range of node '/configuration/adm-mgr/global-configuration/user-groups/user-group/encrypted-password' from 64-67 to 64-200" ;
  }

  revision 2020-07-03 {
    description "(1)Add feature node 'chmode-access'
    (2)Add a new container node. Path:/configuration/adm-mgr/authorization-templates/author-template/chmode-access
    (3)Add list node. Path:/configuration/adm-mgr/authorization-templates/author-template/chmode-access/chmode
    (4)Add leaf node. Path:/configuration/adm-mgr/authorization-templates/author-template/chmode-access/chmode/absolute-path
    (5)Add leaf node. Path:/configuration/adm-mgr/authorization-templates/author-template/chmode-access/chmode/operation-mode" ;
